{
  "name": "Snitcher — Block Optional Telemetry and Probes",
  "description": "Scoped optional telemetry, IP lookup and observed one-off diagnostic probes for Rex, Claude Code, Codex and Orca. Does not prevent application retries. Disable an individual rule or this group for deliberate diagnostics.",
